@startuml
!theme plain

title Alexandrite - tracing architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Customer / Partner API" as user

rectangle "Online Shop" as shop #LightBlue
rectangle "CRM" as crm #LightBlue
rectangle "MES" as mes #LightBlue
queue "RabbitMQ" as rabbit #LightBlue
database "Shop DB" as shopdb
database "MES DB" as mesdb
cloud "S3 Storage\n3D models" as s3

rectangle "OpenTelemetry Collector" as otel #FFCCCC
database "Tempo / Jaeger\nTrace Storage" as trace #FFCCCC
rectangle "Grafana\nTrace UI" as grafana #FFCCCC

user --> shop : HTTP request\ntraceparent
shop --> s3 : upload/download 3D model
shop --> rabbit : publish order event\ntraceparent + correlationId
rabbit --> crm : consume order event
crm --> rabbit : publish production event
rabbit --> mes : consume production event
mes --> rabbit : publish status event
rabbit --> crm : consume status event

shop --> shopdb
crm --> shopdb
mes --> mesdb

shop --> otel : spans
crm --> otel : spans
mes --> otel : spans
rabbit --> otel : queue spans / metrics

otel --> trace : export traces
grafana --> trace : query traces

note right of otel
New tracing component.
Collects spans from Shop, CRM, MES
and RabbitMQ integrations.
end note

@enduml